WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.975
Chapter Six.

00:00:01.925 --> 00:00:04.150
Subversion of the State.

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:11.275
The Hogue Commission confirmed China and India as the most active foreign interference actors in Canadian democracy.

00:00:11.275 --> 00:00:14.850
CIJA lobbied 56 percent of MPs.

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:22.075
The Foreign Influence Transparency Registry has been law for 658 days with zero registrations.

00:00:22.075 --> 00:00:25.550
Chinese police stations operated openly.

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:29.762
The RCMP closed the investigation without charges.
